38249>>>        WebRegisterPath ntNavigateForward oZoomEquipo
38255>>>
38255>>>        Procedure OnRowClick String sRowId
38258>>>            tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38258>>>            tWebNavigateData NavigateData
38258>>>            Get GetNavigateData to NavigateData
38259>>>
